sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetCompositeScheduleRequest (evseId, duration, chargingRateUnit)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId 0<br>duration is <Configured duration><br>chargingRateUnit <Configured chargingRateUnit>

    CS-->>CSMS: GetCompositeScheduleResponse (status = Accepted, schedule.evseId = 0, schedule.duration = 300, schedule.chargingRateUnit = <Specified chargingRateUnit from step 1>, schedule.chargingSchedulePeriod[0].startPeriod = 0, schedule.chargingSchedulePeriod[0].limit = 10)
    Note right of CS: Multiply limit by 1000 if chargingRateUnit is W

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
